      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "'open' is ConnectionCreated minus ConnectionClosed; 'in use' is checkout minus check-in. In-use pinned at open means every connection is busy and queries queue before they are sent. The wrapper does not export MaxPoolSize, so compare against whatever you passed to SetMaxPoolSize (the driver default is 100). Pool metrics are per-process and carry no database label, so this row ignores the Database filter."
    },
